{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1311129001:1":{"text":"너! 너희들! 감히 세레니티 장원에 함부로 쳐들어 오다니! 자작님께서는 손님을 만나는 일이 극히 드물다고!","source_cn":"你！你们！为何擅闯永寂庄园！子爵先生极少接见外客！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AC34A14B9F9C3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311129002:1":{"text":"함부로 쳐들어온 게 아니라 촛대 집사님의 허락을 받고 들어온 거예요. 저희더러 여기서 루보미르를 기다리라고 했다구욧!","source_cn":"我们没有擅闯，是经过烛台管家允许的。是他让我们在这里等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC45BE231255EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311129003:1":{"text":"감히! 자작님의 이름을 막 부르다니! 정말 무례한 녀석이군! 벌을 받아 마땅하다!","source_cn":"你，竟然直呼子爵先生的姓名！真是无理之人！必须受到惩罚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EBCAA87B1DA10CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311129004:1":{"text":"어라?! 성격이 왜 이렇게 난폭하신 거예요... 왜 사람을 때려요!","source_cn":"诶？！你怎么脾气这么暴躁……你怎么打人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C7CDB70126A8D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:烛台守卫":{"text":"촛대 수비병","source":"烛台守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}